Z||000001||The Fieromaster||06-06-2001||01:13 AM||||Well all you do is get the pic uploaded to a web page then Click to the left where it says UBB CODE and it will show you how to put in an IMAGE... Unfortunatly 99% of the free internet hosts are stopping the use of inages on their pages being directly linked to other pages (like your signature would be) sooo you need a web host THANKFULLY Devotshka helped me with my image hosting need THANKS AGAIN!!!!!!!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">  <P>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000<BR>The Fieromaster<BR>Craig Gibson<BR>fieromaster@ncweb.com<BR>1985 GT ~Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)<BR>1985 GT ~Red/grey lowers, grey interior (sold)<BR>1985 SE ~Black, tan inside (sold-needed serious TLC)<BR>1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX (AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000||||reg||1
Z||000002||Jay||06-06-2001||08:06 AM||||There is a much easier way of doing this.  Go down to the bottom of the page and download PIP (Pennock's Image Poster).  Once downloaded open up any photo inside the image poster.  If you are happy with that photo click the button "Post It"  Then minimize the PIP and come back to the forum.  Go to your profile and add any text you want, then just press control-v and the image is posted.  That is it, your signature will always be there when you click on show signature.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Alex4mula||06-06-2001||10:40 AM||||I'm using <A HREF="http://www.zing.com." TARGET=_blank>www.zing.com.</A>  I created an album with signatures. I click in the photo and use that URL.<P>------------------<BR>Alex4mula<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.zing.com/picture/p69fbfe3e99ec5a0b81c10afcc578ff95/fe6d5c42.jpg.orig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
